- 2026-08-24 (final): Voice & Residue round: dialogue-music pass (three-way voice fingerprints now measurable; contraction axis 0.00/0.11/0.33), openers to 20% target, abstract-of frames to 7.4/10k under flag, neighbor-tiles beat closes M8. #13 -> 7, #26 -> 8. Raw overall 7.40; system-adjusted 7.21. Trim toward 10k deferred until >20k or content-complete per user direction.
